s": ["VRGladiator", "VRSwordFighting", "GladiatorCombat", "VRArenaBattle", "SwordCombat"], "long_description": "ENTER THE ARENA. FIGHT FOR GLORY. BECOME A TITAN.\n\nStep into Arena of Titans, an intense VR gladiator combat game where every battle tests your strength, skill, and survival instincts.\n\nEnter three unique battle arenas and face ruthless gladiators in immersive first-person sword fighting. Wield seven distinct swords, each with its own capabilities and combat style. Master your attacks, manage stamina, protect your health, and use your shield to defend against deadly strikes.\n\nThe challenge grows as powerful enemies unleash their abilities and multiple opponents surround you. Adapt your strategy, perfect your timing, and fight your way through every encounter.\n\nFEATURES\n\n\u2694\ufe0f 7 Unique Swords: Discover different weapons and combat capabilities.\n\n\ud83c\udfdb\ufe0f 3 Battle Arenas: Fight across distinct gladiator battlegrounds.\n\n\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f Sword & Shield Combat: Block, attack, and manage your stamina to survive.\n\n\ud83d\udd25 Powerful Enemies: Face gladiators with special abilities and challenging attacks.\n\n\ud83d\udcaa Intense VR Battles: Experience immersive melee combat where your movements matter.\n\nThe arena awaits. Your enemies are ready.\n\nWill you survive, or become another fallen gladiator?\n\nEnter Arena of Titans and prove your worth!", "short_description": "Enter the arena, master 7 unique swords, battle powerful gladiators, and survive brutal VR combat. Fight for glory. Become a Titan."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.techbeel.com/games/arena-of-titans/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Techbeel", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://techbeel.com/games/arena-of-titans", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "